WEBVTT

05:00.667 --> 05:03.585
Okay. Hey, thank you. At ease.

05:04.837 --> 05:06.296
Hey, uh, Slinky?

05:06.381 --> 05:09.216
Right here, Woody.
I'm red this time.

05:09.300 --> 05:11.510
-No. Slink...
-Oh, well, all right.

05:11.594 --> 05:12.761
You can be red if you want.

05:12.845 --> 05:15.931
-Not now, Slink. I got some bad news.
-Bad news?

05:18.268 --> 05:20.269
Just gather everyone up
for a staff meeting, and be happy.

05:20.353 --> 05:21.353
Got it.

05:21.437 --> 05:22.771
Be happy!

05:23.606 --> 05:26.525
Staff meeting, everybody!
Snake, Robot, podium duty.

05:27.151 --> 05:28.527
Hey.
